{"1856980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "VirtualSociety", "steam_appid": 1856980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856980/extras/3765c6700414628c630d30d45c37e83c.avif?t=1785755781\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every place can become a story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VirtualSociety is a new kind of creative life sim. Rather than imposing a predefined way of life, it gives you the tools to build places, create residents, and design the interactions that bring your own stories to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a cozy bedroom to a whole street, from a quiet café to a shared world, every space can become a stage. Create on your own, play as your characters, then invite friends to explore, roleplay, and bring your imagined worlds to life together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build the places your stories need</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856980/extras/6afefa659b1eec3f7f40ef3531e99440.poster.avif?t=1785755781\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856980/extras/6afefa659b1eec3f7f40ef3531e99440.webm?t=1785755781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856980/extras/6afefa659b1eec3f7f40ef3531e99440.mp4?t=1785755781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design rooms, homes, streets, cafés, schools, or more unusual worlds. Place, transform, and customize walls, objects, materials, and atmosphere with visual tools designed to remain accessible without sacrificing precision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create the residents your worlds need</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856980/extras/5a30e7dc4e710299fd609dc80dae81f1.poster.avif?t=1785755781\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856980/extras/5a30e7dc4e710299fd609dc80dae81f1.webm?t=1785755781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856980/extras/5a30e7dc4e710299fd609dc80dae81f1.mp4?t=1785755781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize their body shapes, faces, outfits, and styles. Create the residents, visitors, friends, rivals, or roleplay characters your world needs, then play as any of them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decide what can happen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856980/extras/1ae1f41accb8784439eb4b833abaf9fc.poster.avif?t=1785755781\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856980/extras/1ae1f41accb8784439eb4b833abaf9fc.webm?t=1785755781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856980/extras/1ae1f41accb8784439eb4b833abaf9fc.mp4?t=1785755781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful setting is only the beginning. Add dialogue, choices, object interactions, events, and story moments to turn a static place into a playable scene that reacts to what you do.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play solo. Tell stories together.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856980/extras/dbfe8aa493f8257be0ea20248e175cfe.avif?t=1785755781\" width=960 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and explore at your own pace, prepare a world for roleplay, or create with friends. VirtualSociety is designed so other players can visit your worlds and bring the stories you've imagined to life with you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your world. Your characters. Your stories.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VirtualSociety is for life sim fans, worldbuilders, storytellers, roleplayers, and anyone who loves creating places where stories can happen. The place is the stage, the residents are the cast — and you set the story in motion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VirtualSociety is currently in development. The tools, content, and modes shown reflect the vision for the game and may evolve from build to build.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856980/extras/3765c6700414628c630d30d45c37e83c.avif?t=1785755781\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every place can become a story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VirtualSociety is a new kind of creative life sim. Rather than imposing a predefined way of life, it gives you the tools to build places, create residents, and design the interactions that bring your own stories to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a cozy bedroom to a whole street, from a quiet café to a shared world, every space can become a stage. Create on your own, play as your characters, then invite friends to explore, roleplay, and bring your imagined worlds to life together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build the places your stories need</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856980/extras/6afefa659b1eec3f7f40ef3531e99440.poster.avif?t=1785755781\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856980/extras/6afefa659b1eec3f7f40ef3531e99440.webm?t=1785755781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856980/extras/6afefa659b1eec3f7f40ef3531e99440.mp4?t=1785755781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design rooms, homes, streets, cafés, schools, or more unusual worlds. Place, transform, and customize walls, objects, materials, and atmosphere with visual tools designed to remain accessible without sacrificing precision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create the residents your worlds need</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856980/extras/5a30e7dc4e710299fd609dc80dae81f1.poster.avif?t=1785755781\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856980/extras/5a30e7dc4e710299fd609dc80dae81f1.webm?t=1785755781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856980/extras/5a30e7dc4e710299fd609dc80dae81f1.mp4?t=1785755781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize their body shapes, faces, outfits, and styles. Create the residents, visitors, friends, rivals, or roleplay characters your world needs, then play as any of them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decide what can happen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856980/extras/1ae1f41accb8784439eb4b833abaf9fc.poster.avif?t=1785755781\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856980/extras/1ae1f41accb8784439eb4b833abaf9fc.webm?t=1785755781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856980/extras/1ae1f41accb8784439eb4b833abaf9fc.mp4?t=1785755781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful setting is only the beginning. Add dialogue, choices, object interactions, events, and story moments to turn a static place into a playable scene that reacts to what you do.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play solo. Tell stories together.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856980/extras/dbfe8aa493f8257be0ea20248e175cfe.avif?t=1785755781\" width=960 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and explore at your own pace, prepare a world for roleplay, or create with friends. VirtualSociety is designed so other players can visit your worlds and bring the stories you've imagined to life with you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your world. Your characters. Your stories.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VirtualSociety is for life sim fans, worldbuilders, storytellers, roleplayers, and anyone who loves creating places where stories can happen. The place is the stage, the residents are the cast — and you set the story in motion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VirtualSociety is currently in development. The tools, content, and modes shown reflect the vision for the game and may evolve from build to build.</p>", "short_description": "VirtualSociety is a creative life sim where you build your own worlds, customize their residents, and design how they interact. Create the places your stories need, play as your characters, and share your worlds with friends.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Italian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic